sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Telegram sender
    participant C as DailyFoodCommand
    participant R as DailyFoodRepository
    participant D as DailyRepository
    participant DB as SQLite
    U->>C: /eat via shortcut or /dfoods -C
    Note over C: Validate arguments; resolve user and food
    C->>R: registerConsumption(user, food, grams, now)
    R->>DB: BEGIN
    R->>D: getOrCreateForDate(user, local date)
    D->>DB: INSERT daily ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
    D->>DB: SELECT daily by user and date
    DB-->>D: Daily row
    D-->>R: Daily row
    R->>DB: INSERT daily_foods
    alt Database writes succeed
        R->>DB: COMMIT
        R-->>C: Entry ID
        C->>R: readForUser(entry ID, user)
        R-->>C: Owned entry
        C-->>U: Saved entry details
    else Database exception
        R->>DB: ROLLBACK
        R-->>C: Rethrow exception
    end
